Why This Setup Wins:
Zero Style Interference: Because the UI wrapper is inside a ShadowDOM, global styling changes on ChatGPT or Claude won't break your command palette layout.

Framework-Aware Injections: Using the native HTMLTextAreaElement.prototype.value setter ensures that modern frontend frameworks (like React on ChatGPT or Next.js on Claude) register the text change instantly without resetting.

Manifest V3 Compliant: Completely adheres to modern extension security models with isolated service workers and explicit host permissions.

